    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of &quot;Survival Spin&quot;, use your own survival strategies to pull the apocalyptic lever and write your own wasteland legend!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A post-apocalyptic world created by Roguelike!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect hundreds of items and unlock dozens of skills!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as uniquely gifted survivors!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the ultimate mutated boss awaiting your challenge at the end!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple strategies and difficulty levels to choose from\u2014forge a survival strategy to conquer the wasteland!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of &quot;Survival Spin&quot;, use your own survival strategies to pull the apocalyptic lever and write your own wasteland legend!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A post-apocalyptic world created by Roguelike!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect hundreds of items and unlock dozens of skills!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as uniquely gifted survivors!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the ultimate mutated boss awaiting your challenge at the end!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple strategies and difficulty levels to choose from\u2014forge a survival strategy to conquer the wasteland!</p></li></ul>",
